mountbridge (1.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release. Changes are in CHANGELOG.md; notably, SMB share
    discovery now accepts credentials, and new mounts default to ~/mnt.

 -- Ben <ben@mutefx.net>  Thu, 01 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000

mountbridge (1.2.0) unstable; urgency=high

  * First Debian package. Upstream changes are in CHANGELOG.md; notably,
    1.2.0 replaces the 1.1 sudoers rule, which allowed root escalation,
    with a validating root helper usable by the 'mountbridge' group.
  * Ask the installing user whether to join the 'mountbridge' group; never
    add anyone during unattended installs.

 -- Ben <ben@mutefx.net>  Thu, 24 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000
